as da cidade, garantindo praticidade no dia a dia.\n\nUm Estilo de Vida Completo\n\nImóvel de alto padrão, com ambientes bem distribuídos e acabamento de qualidade, em um condomínio seguro e acolhedor.\n\nAgende uma visita e conheça de perto tudo o que o Boulevard Boa Vista pode oferecer para você e sua família.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/87b98943-cf15-42d1-b777-7bbb8c4133b6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b425e00d-a4f4-4741-bc9b-05d35242ba03.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3fcc4cd8-b138-4f61-8e12-91affd07e05c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ea6b7f2a-573f-4969-ab74-6721bac74cb0.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/078e2f8c-4be2-4311-b2b1-b738b1e2ee04.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/452dbc7e-98a5-4e58-b9af-e30eb4b86a97.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e48cfc6f-e80e-455c-90e6-d0a7be745e2e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/bc6194ed-6d85-4ae7-87d9-c90b725a6d36.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fb1cfd97-69f8-4f19-8d84-cc64938b79b4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ba1ff923-9e22-4dc6-8284-f8e997ce6fee.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/68c41172c633a8a2d738a642/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d43e808b-c79c-4490-a72d-bd6de7d39012.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3